Architecture Components
•	Azure Blob Storage (Source): Stores source files- Videos in containers.
Data Ingestion: RPA to be used to search for recent calls / loans and interface with Verint system to get latest videos, if needed, convert to required format (.mp4)  and upload them to Azure Blob storage.
 
•	Content Understanding Service (AI model): Pretrained Analyzers ( uses speech / vison / Video Indexer -all built in Foundry ) for Video Processing . Uses GenAI prompts to extract data from audio Transcript and Video frames with OCR.
 
•	Python Service or a Python Function App / Orchestration layer : 
              -  The backend that uses azure-storage-blob to read data,
- Calls Content Understanding service ,
- Gets .json results and fills the Rubric DB ( Azure CosmosDB )  to store results . 
 
             Data Visualization :
- A front-end web portal will be developed to search/view/list latest calls and the quality parameters ( Rubric attributes) for those calls – Interfacing with CosmosDB.
                            - As next phase this data can be used to build a RAG chatbot to get insights of these calls.
 
•	Azure Key Vault: Stores credentials securely for connecting the Python application to storage/ CosmosDB/ Content Understanding and other end points
•	Azure Active Directory (Entra ID): Manages secure access for the Python application.
